<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress-Sept 6.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress-Sept 6.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress as of Sept 6.</p>
<p>CROP			   COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat	 21</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring	 12</p>
<p>Soft White Spring Wheat     69</p>
<p>Winter Wheat		    97</p>
<p>Durum Wheat		     61</p>
<p>Oats				14</p>
<p>Barley			    31</p>
<p>Flax				10</p>
<p>Fall Rye			  79</p>
<p>Canola			    27</p>
<p>Average All Crops	     26</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
